                                "sense_id": "e1ab2091-21ca-3f72-8bf0-ff168308b45b",
                                "text": "And forasmuch as his return hath been longer then I looked for, I have sent thus expressly to know both of him, and of you, the cause of this retardment of his."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7cc1bb1f-30d5-4d9f-af58-664cf9466639",
                                "sense_id": "e1ab2091-21ca-3f72-8bf0-ff168308b45b",
                                "text": "Despite the retardments occasioned by the war, and the heavy financial loss suffered from the freeing of 1200 slaves in Tazewell, the wealth of the county was not seriously impaired."
                            }
